# OSPUSH PLUGIN - an image onto a running node
#
#        one defined method is mandatory:
#        - push   responsible for pushing the image path onto the running node. returns <True|False>,"message"

# Plugin selection based on the following search path and priority:
#
# 1 node name                 e.g. plugins/osimage/operations/ospush/node001.py
# 2 distribution              e.g. plugins/osimage/operations/ospush/redhat.py
# 3 osimage name              e.g. plugins/osimage/operations/ospush/compute.py
# 4 group name                e.g. plugins/osimage/operations/ospush/compute.py
# 5 default                   e.g. plugins/osimage/operations/ospush/default.py
#
# A push to a whole group starts at step 2.
